  "details": "I think the VRChat text box should have a higher character limit or an option to expand it. Right now it feels a little too short, especially when trying to type longer messages, explain something, roleplay, introduce yourself, or have conversations without needing to split everything into multiple messages.\n\nA larger text box with more available characters would make communication easier for players who prefer typing, can't use voice chat, or just want to express themselves better.\n\nMaybe there could even be a setting where users can choose between the current short text box and an extended text box mode.\n\nI think this would be a great quality-of-life improvement for the community. ✨",
